# Vacuity receipts directory marker (v26.10.20, lane A11).
#
# Per-court receipt graphs are written here by the court runner as
# vacuity-receipts-<gate-id>.ttl (RESOLUTIONS.md, "Vacuity schema ns vc:" row).
#
# RECEIPTS ARE RUNNER-WRITTEN, NEVER HAND-EDITED.
# A hand-edited receipt is contract drift: it no longer describes what ran.
# Verify, do not modify: ggen receipt verify / the L13 refusal registry.

@prefix vc: <http://ggen.io/vacuity-court#> .

vc:receipts-directory
    vc:writer "court-runner" ;
    vc:hand-edit "forbidden" ;
    vc:naming "vacuity-receipts-<gate-id>.ttl" .
